{"lyrics":"[Instrumental Intro]\n[00:22.12](Kirk Kneezy On The Beat, Yeah)\n[00:24.34]Demon girl, how come you hold me close? (Close)\n[00:28.30]I like it, don't let go (Go), you are my overdose (Dose)\n[00:33.28]In the underworld, we ro-o-o-oam (Ro-o-o-oam, roam)\n[00:35.52]O-o-o-oam (Ro-o-o-oam, roam)\n[00:36.76]O-o-o-oam (Ro-o-o-oam, roam)\n[00:44.98]O-o-o-oam (Ro-o-o-oam, roam)\n[00:48.84]I was gettin' my heart broke, now I'm the heartbreaker (Heartbreaker)\n[00:51.70]She be drawin' pentagrams, she a soul-taker (Soul-taker)\n[00:54.72]When she took me to her room, all I saw was three six (All I saw was three six)\n[00:57.86]I know that's what heartbreak is made of\n[00:59.74]Three nine on my wrist, bitch, hell upside (Three nine on my wrist, bitch, hell upside)\n[01:02.66]Cupid try to kill you, I'm in the crossfire (Cupid try to kill you, I'm in the crossfire)\n[01:06.72]Demons come in handy, like a spare tire (Demons come in handy, like a spare tire)\n[01:09.82]They put my life on the wire (They put my life on the wire)\n[01:11.62]Yeah, I'm gettin' higher than higher (Yeah, I'm gettin' higher than higher)\n[01:13.88]Pill pop shorty, I do not need a lighter (Pill pop shorty, I do not need a lighter)\n[01:18.00]Heart stop shorty, I'ma go out flyin' (Heart stop shorty, I'ma go out flyin')\n[01:20.94]Let me stop playin', bitch, I already died (Let me stop playin', bitch, I already died)\n[01:24.56]Demon girl, how come you hold me close? (Close)\n[01:28.30]I like it, don't let go (Go), you are my overdose (Dose)\n[01:33.20]In the underworld, we ro-o-o-oam (Ro-o-o-oam, roam)\n[01:36.02]O-o-o-oam (Ro-o-o-oam, roam)\n[01:36.72]O-o-o-oam (Ro-o-o-oam, roam)\n[01:44.02]O-o-o-oam (Ro-o-o-oam, roam)\n[01:44.96]Here we go, It was all heaven, just a week ago (Here we go, It was all heaven, just a week ago)\n[01:52.26]Now I'm up in hell, with my eyes closed (Now I'm up in hell, with my eyes closed)\n[01:55.42]Gettin' sucked up by a devil ho-o-o-o (Gettin' sucked up by a devil ho-o-o-o)\n[01:58.38]Takin' these pills on an empty stomach (Takin' these pills on an empty stomach)\n[02:00.52]It's like gettin' fucked up with the devil, ho (It's like gettin' fucked up with the devil, ho)\n[02:04.20]Fuck her to my favorite heavy metal, ho (Fuck her to my favorite heavy metal, ho)\n[02:08.22]We know all the words, so it's special, so, so special (So it's special, so, so special)\n[02:12.10]I loved her and let her go (Go, go, go), fuck that (Fuck that)\n[02:14.96]Maybe I'ma hold her close, get the fuck back (Fuck back)\n[02:18.02]I'm about to overdose, and she love that (Love that)\n[02:20.94]Story of a demon seducin' a young drug head (Story of a demon seducin' a young drug head)\n[02:24.34]Demon girl, how come you hold me close? (Close)\n[02:28.30]I like it, don't let go (Go), you are my overdose (Dose)\n[02:34.38]In the underworld, we ro-o-o-oam (Ro-o-o-oam, roam)\n[02:38.06]O-o-o-oam (Ro-o-o-oam, roam)\n[02:42.76]O-o-o-oam (Ro-o-o-oam, roam)\n[02:46.08]O-o-o-oam (Ro-o-o-oam, roam)","words":[[22.12,22.34,"(Kirk"],[22.4,22.72,"Kneezy"],[22.92,22.96,"On"],[23.02,23.1,"The"],[23.26,23.48,"Beat,"],[23.62,23.96,"Yeah)"],[24.34,24.68,"Demon"],[24.74,24.8,"girl,"],[25.08,25.34,"how"],[25.46,25.84,"come"],[25.88,26.06,"you"],[26.2,26.52,"hold"],[26.6,26.68,"me"],[26.9,27.78,"close?"],[27.82,28.16,"(Close)"],[28.3,28.3,"I"],[28.44,28.94,"like"],[29.02,29.1,"it,"],[29.18,29.52,"don't"],[29.58,29.8,"let"],[29.84,29.86,"go"],[29.96,30.04,"(Go),"],[31.14,31.22,"you"],[31.56,31.72,"are"],[31.86,32.14,"my"],[32.44,32.94,"overdose"],[32.98,33.24,"(Dose)"],[33.28,33.36,"In"],[33.46,33.62,"the"],[34.04,34.28,"underworld,"],[34.32,34.34,"we"],[34.38,34.74,"ro-o-o-oam"],[35.02,35.36,"(Ro-o-o-oam,"],[35.4,35.46,"roam)"],[35.52,35.84,"O-o-o-oam"],[35.94,36.32,"(Ro-o-o-oam,"],[36.38,36.66,"roam)"],[36.76,44.24,"O-o-o-oam"],[44.28,44.64,"(Ro-o-o-oam,"],[44.68,44.94,"roam)"],[44.98,47.88,"O-o-o-oam"],[48.34,48.64,"(Ro-o-o-oam,"],[48.68,48.78,"roam)"],[48.84,48.84,"I"],[